<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Copene starts as sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Copene starts as sell.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Thursday analysts Eric Graber-Lopez, Jay Bhutani and Phokion Potamianos had started coverage of Brazilian petrochemical company Petroquimica do Nordeste SA, or Copene, with a rating of sell.</p>
<p>-- In a Feb 4 analysis, they wrote that the current valuation of the company was unattractive.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
